Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.44,0:00:06.41,Narrator,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs41}Mega Evolution...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.34,0:00:10.04,Narrator,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs41}...is the endless potential a Pokémon possesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.88,0:00:13.63,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The disappearance of the legendary megalith that is the root of all this...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.42,0:00:17.98,Narrator,,0,0,0,,...turned out to be a mere sign of what was to come.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.79,0:00:44.14,MegaTitle,,0,0,0,,{\fs25\fad(2533,1189)\pos(630,530)}The Strongest Mega Evolution ~Act III~
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.79,0:00:44.14,MegaTitle,,0,0,0,,{\fs25\fad(2533,1189)\pos(630,530)\blur6}The Strongest Mega Evolution ~Act III~
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.23,0:00:47.97,Manon,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs41}All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.40,0:00:50.36,Manon,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.95,0:00:52.95,Manon,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs41}What a great view!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.56,0:00:55.98,Manon,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs41}It's called "Devon Corporation", Hari-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.33,0:00:59.09,Manon,,0,0,0,,This company belongs to Daigo-san's father, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.50,0:01:02.11,Alan,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs41}I'll go on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.88,0:01:03.16,Manon,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs41}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.04,0:01:05.57,Manon,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs41}What? Non, non!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.16,0:01:08.89,Manon,,0,0,0,,Tell me, don't you have this thing called "emotion"?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.28,0:01:11.05,Alan,,0,0,0,,This is urgent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.06,0:01:14.08,Alan,,0,0,0,,You can come with me, but don't get in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.42,0:01:17.84,Manon,,0,0,0,,That guy really is too uptight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.93,0:01:35.77,Warning,,0,0,0,,{\fad(523,475)\pos(640,40)}While watching anime, make sure not to sit too close to the screen and that the room is well lit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.89,0:01:29.00,Daigo,,0,0,0,,This is footage from the sea 200 kilometers off Kanazumi City here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.50,0:01:30.94,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Let me show you our footage as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.64,0:01:35.19,Alan,,0,0,0,,What's this advancing object?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.58,0:01:38.45,Daigo,,0,0,0,,I suspect it's the Continent Pokémon Groudon...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.23,0:01:39.90,Manon,,0,0,0,,"Groudon"?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.78,0:01:41.28,Alan,,0,0,0,,This is...?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.85,0:01:44.19,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,It is a Pokémon said to have expanded the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.60,0:01:46.41,Manon,,0,0,0,,So this little one is a Pokémon too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.85,0:01:47.28,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:48.83,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,I want you to see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.50,0:01:52.12,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Could this be...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.88,0:01:53.67,Daigo,,0,0,0,,...Primal Reversion?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.41,0:01:55.07,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Most likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.96,0:01:56.80,Alan,,0,0,0,,"Primal Reversion"?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.92,0:02:06.80,ExtraType,,0,0,0,,{\fs37\fad(564,515)\pos(612,536)}Play a board game via the Pocket Monsters XY data broadcast!\NPress the d-button on your remote and try reaching the battles and the presents!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.47,0:01:58.49,Daigo,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs41}According to books,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.84,0:02:02.73,Daigo,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs41}it's believed to restore the Pokémon's original appearance...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.24,0:02:04.28,Daigo,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs41}...and the great power it's supposed to have.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.04,0:02:05.72,Daigo,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs41}However,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.20,0:02:07.85,Daigo,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs41}if Groudon has appeared,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.48,0:02:09.10,Daigo,,0,0,0,,the other one...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.55,0:02:11.73,Manon,,0,0,0,,"The other one"? Does that mean there's one more?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.23,0:02:14.22,Alan,,0,0,0,,Manon! I told you not to get in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.47,0:02:16.55,Manon,,0,0,0,,I'm not in the way, I'm asking a question!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.11,0:02:24.01,OperatorA,,0,0,0,,South from Rune City, deep in the ocean, we've captured a response from a huge living creature currently in motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.43,0:02:25.68,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me that's Kyogre!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.85,0:02:26.45,Alan,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.10,0:02:27.66,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,I knew it...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.65,0:02:37.50,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Has it come to destroy the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.17,0:02:38.92,Manon,,0,0,0,,"Destroy"?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.44,0:02:40.29,Daigo,,0,0,0,,It's a myth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.22,0:02:43.92,Daigo,,0,0,0,,A myth that's been passed on since olden times.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.46,0:02:48.23,Daigo,,0,0,0,,In the super-ancient world, Primal Groudon was said to have expanded the land,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.92,0:02:51.16,Daigo,,0,0,0,,while Primal Kyogre was said to have spread the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.99,0:02:56.63,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Apparently, the two fought continuously for a certain kind of great energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.24,0:03:03.44,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Their fight shook heaven and earth violently, putting the world at risk of collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.01,0:03:20.94,Daigo,,0,0,0,,There is also the belief that the energy the two were after is that legendary megalith.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.31,0:03:23.16,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,That's right. The situation is grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.03,0:03:31.43,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,If the energy we've detected off the coast of Kanazumi City really does indicate the appearance of the legendary megalith...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.27,0:03:33.33,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Groudon on the sea...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.91,0:03:35.11,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Kyogre deep within the sea...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.95,0:03:38.40,Daigo,,0,0,0,,If we estimate the direction in which they're advancing....
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.99,0:03:41.04,Manon,,0,0,0,,They all overlap.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.84,0:03:43.52,Alan,,0,0,0,,So it's all according to the myth...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.49,0:03:45.98,Daigo,,0,0,0,,If that happens, the world will...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.77,0:03:47.50,Manon,,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.50,0:03:49.76,Alan,,0,0,0,,Director, I will head to the site.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.76,0:03:52.17,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'll count on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.51,0:03:55.76,Daigo,,0,0,0,,I'll go too. Let me prepare a means of transport.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.05,0:03:57.08,Alan,,0,0,0,,Yeah, please do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.40,0:03:59.76,Manon,,0,0,0,,Uhm...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.60,0:04:01.04,Manon,,0,0,0,,Daigo-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.37,0:04:03.50,Manon,,0,0,0,,Isn't this dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.96,0:04:05.87,Daigo,,0,0,0,,We're only going to check the situation from the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.92,0:04:07.63,Daigo,,0,0,0,,I'll go on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.96,0:04:08.21,Alan,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.29,0:04:11.89,Manon,,0,0,0,,Uh, Alan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.70,0:04:13.29,Manon,,0,0,0,,What about your shoulder?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.89,0:04:15.04,Manon,,0,0,0,,Doesn't it hurt any more?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.36,0:04:16.71,Alan,,0,0,0,,No, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.34,0:04:22.12,Alan,,0,0,0,,There's no time to dawdle around. I'll go on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.83,0:04:25.08,Manon,,0,0,0,,I'm not going.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.13,0:04:26.52,Alan,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.78,0:04:27.96,Manon,,0,0,0,,Alan, you musn't go either!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.69,0:04:30.44,Manon,,0,0,0,,I'm scared...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.83,0:04:31.40,Manon,,0,0,0,,So much...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.16,0:04:33.11,Manon,,0,0,0,,Alan, aren't {\i1}you{\i0} scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.88,0:04:36.16,Manon,,0,0,0,,Rayquaza was really angry back then...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.12,0:04:41.16,Manon,,0,0,0,,Rayquaza alone was {\i1}that{\i0} strong...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.67,0:04:44.22,Manon,,0,0,0,,...and now there's two Pokémon that want to wreck the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.49,0:04:44.89,Manon,,0,0,0,,Alan...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.73,0:04:47.23,Manon,,0,0,0,,This time you won't get away with just an injury...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.99,0:04:49.26,Alan,,0,0,0,,This is a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.95,0:04:50.63,Manon,,0,0,0,,A promise?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.88,0:04:53.26,Alan,,0,0,0,,A promise to the director.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.31,0:04:55.57,Alan,,0,0,0,,I have to gain power...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.51,0:04:58.03,Alan,,0,0,0,,...and become strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.08,0:05:01.18,Alan,,0,0,0,,I have to become the strongest...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.71,0:05:02.87,Manon,,0,0,0,,But to become the strongest,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.59,0:05:04.97,Manon,,0,0,0,,how far will you have to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.58,0:05:07.29,Manon,,0,0,0,,Do you have to fight against the world's destruction?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.29,0:05:08.44,Alan,,0,0,0,,What do {\i1}you{\i0} know about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.81,0:05:12.37,Manon,,0,0,0,,But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.17,0:05:14.07,Manon,,0,0,0,,...don't want...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.48,0:05:15.99,Manon,,0,0,0,,anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.04,0:05:18.08,Manon,,0,0,0,,...to happen to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.52,0:05:21.36,Alan,,0,0,0,,Go back to Kalos.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.85,0:05:22.94,Manon,,0,0,0,,Uh, Alan...!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.14,0:05:26.67,Manon,,0,0,0,,Wait, Alan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.33,0:05:32.05,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Are you really okay with leaving her behind?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.57,0:05:33.74,Alan,,0,0,0,,She's just a burden.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.15,0:05:37.80,Daigo,,0,0,0,,I don't quite believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.43,0:05:39.06,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Oops, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.19,0:05:41.96,Daigo,,0,0,0,,And here I thought it was your way of being kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.53,0:06:33.83,Daigo,,0,0,0,,As one would expect, it's hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.65,0:06:37.64,OperatorB,,0,0,0,,The temperature of the air outside is over 60 degrees Celsius and still rising.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.11,0:06:50.07,Manon,,0,0,0,,Ugh, it's hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.32,0:06:52.32,Manon,,0,0,0,,Hari-san, fire an Ice Beam.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.82,0:06:54.38,Manon,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.65,0:07:01.76,OperatorC,,0,0,0,,In a short time, we'll reach our destination, point zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.17,0:07:06.17,OperatorC,,0,0,0,,Groudon detected.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.45,0:07:11.15,Reporter,,0,0,0,,Groudon has suddenly appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.67,0:07:13.71,Reporter,,0,0,0,,Just where is it heading?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.95,0:07:16.36,Officer,,0,0,0,,It is dangerous here. Please leave immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.03,0:07:19.36,Officer,,0,0,0,,It is dangerous here. Please leave immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.36,0:07:23.09,Manon,,0,0,0,,Is that Groudon?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.75,0:07:30.21,Man,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.52,0:07:56.73,OperatorD,,0,0,0,,We have a high energy response from point zero off Kanazumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.59,0:07:58.33,Daigo,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.26,0:08:03.44,OperatorE,,0,0,0,,The pattern matches with that of the megalith.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.11,0:08:05.35,Daigo,,0,0,0,,It really {\i1}is{\i0} that megalith...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.28,0:08:07.20,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Can you two hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.57,0:08:07.99,Alan,,0,0,0,,Director?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.65,0:08:09.33,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Fleur-de-lis-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.40,0:08:12.05,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,We've detected the energy as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.72,0:08:14.63,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Though we've had no response from it as a single entity yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.48,0:08:17.00,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,We don't know what will happen from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.37,0:08:19.50,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Take good care of yourself when proceeding with the investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.97,0:08:20.16,Alan,,0,0,0,,We will.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.75,0:08:21.48,Daigo,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.45,0:08:23.55,OperatorD,,0,0,0,,Something is moving through the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.87,0:08:25.22,OperatorD,,0,0,0,,It will reach the surface before long.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.79,0:08:37.75,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Kyogre...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.08,0:09:28.91,Man2,,0,0,0,,What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.19,0:09:30.24,Man3,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.69,0:09:57.45,Manon,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.58,0:10:02.16,Manon,,0,0,0,,I-Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.91,0:10:04.89,Manon,,0,0,0,,...Kyogre?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.92,0:10:18.92,Commercialblue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(350,630)}Coming up next:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.92,0:10:13.91,Commercialblue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(480,630)\an1\fad(0,472)}Clash! Legend VS Legend!!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.98,0:10:18.92,Commercialblue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(480,630)\an1\fad(459,0)}What is the Houen region's fate!?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.67,0:10:12.99,Narrator,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)}This program is brought to you by these sponsors.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.77,0:10:25.12,Reporter,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs41}Does Groudon and Kyogre's appearance mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.12,0:10:29.66,Reporter,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs41}...the myth passed down here in the Houen region will become reality now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.95,0:10:32.94,OperatorF,,0,0,0,,The expansion rate of the energy above the sea has increased even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.46,0:10:37.27,OperatorF,,0,0,0,,As a result, the crystallographic density is increasing faster and faster. It's beginning to solidify.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.06,0:10:39.47,Daigo,,0,0,0,,It's the megalith, as expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.08,0:10:40.31,Alan,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.35,0:10:45.35,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me, Alan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.91,0:10:48.35,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,This message is for you only.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.33,0:10:51.74,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,The vanished megalith will probably crystallize here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.26,0:10:56.10,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,We'll be heading there as well. Until then, please protect the megalith from those two.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.63,0:10:58.86,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Being in the hands of humans is what gives that thing meaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.04,0:11:00.68,Alan,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.64,0:11:09.27,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Alan, what are you up to?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.60,0:11:10.37,Alan,,0,0,0,,We'll stop those two!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.88,0:11:12.43,Alan,,0,0,0,,Go, Lizardon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.67,0:11:21.34,Alan,,0,0,0,,Lizardon,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.03,0:11:23.09,Alan,,0,0,0,,mega evolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.63,0:11:39.64,Manon,,0,0,0,,Mega Lizardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.63,0:12:03.02,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Are you telling me Lizardon can protect the megalith from those two all by itself?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.28,0:12:04.77,Alan,,0,0,0,,I can't just watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.20,0:12:06.66,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Geez, I can't believe you...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.86,0:12:08.59,Daigo,,0,0,0,,We'll take on Kyogre.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.06,0:12:10.72,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Metagross, mega evolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.86,0:12:23.62,Alan,,0,0,0,,Flamethrower!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.97,0:12:24.82,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Flash Cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.62,0:12:49.98,Alan,,0,0,0,,Dragon Claw!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.21,0:13:05.15,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Meteor Mash!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.32,0:13:24.29,Alan,,0,0,0,,Steel Wing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.43,0:13:43.33,Alan,,0,0,0,,Lizardon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.17,0:14:03.59,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Alan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.02,0:14:11.11,Manon,,0,0,0,,Huh? Alan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.60,0:14:14.24,Manon,,0,0,0,,Alan, stop! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.24,0:14:15.02,Alan,,0,0,0,,Lizardon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.53,0:14:27.02,Alan,,0,0,0,,Lizardon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.98,0:14:30.04,Alan,,0,0,0,,Return, Lizardon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.39,0:14:46.21,Manon,,0,0,0,,Alan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.03,0:14:50.76,Manon,,0,0,0,,Open! Open, open!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.80,0:14:52.51,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Descend!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.93,0:14:53.26,OperatorG,,0,0,0,,Understood!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.59,0:15:00.39,Manon,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.72,0:15:01.15,OperatorH,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.84,0:15:02.18,Daigo,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.72,0:15:03.64,OperatorH,,0,0,0,,The rear hatch!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.78,0:15:06.48,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Manon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.16,0:15:08.11,Manon,,0,0,0,,Alan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.14,0:15:10.10,Manon,,0,0,0,,Alan, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.01,0:15:11.61,Manon,,0,0,0,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.08,0:15:13.00,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Manon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.87,0:15:24.77,Manon,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.31,0:15:31.07,Manon,,0,0,0,,Metagross, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.45,0:15:35.57,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Well done, Metagross.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.05,0:15:37.26,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Keep protecting the two of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.44,0:16:12.70,Manon,,0,0,0,,I've got to hand it to you, Hari-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.52,0:16:24.07,Manon,,0,0,0,,I wonder if he'll be all right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.70,0:16:28.21,Manon,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.38,0:16:47.74,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,It has finally regenerated.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.59,0:17:03.26,Manon,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.71,0:17:04.18,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Could it be...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.32,0:17:14.75,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Mega...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.18,0:17:15.82,Manon,,0,0,0,,...Rayquaza?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.40,0:18:53.04,Daigo,,0,0,0,,I can't believe its power...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.19,0:18:56.77,Manon,,0,0,0,,Alan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.31,0:18:59.87,Alan,,0,0,0,,Manon?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.93,0:19:03.67,Alan,,0,0,0,,Rayquaza?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.24,0:19:11.22,Daigo,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.71,0:19:22.39,OperatorI,,0,0,0,,The response from the megalith has vanished!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.39,0:19:22.90,Daigo,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.18,0:19:40.80,Daigo,,0,0,0,,The megalith has disappeared...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.11,0:19:41.89,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,It's a success.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.89,0:19:42.26,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.48,0:19:51.42,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,We've analyzed the components we gathered from the megalith last time and created a system that blocks its energy radiation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.14,0:19:56.03,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Daigo-san, the megalith will remain with me for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.70,0:19:57.79,Daigo,,0,0,0,,With you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.50,0:20:00.70,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Yes, I will take it to Kalos.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.10,0:20:08.12,Manon,,0,0,0,,I wonder what that was about.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.12,0:20:10.46,Alan,,0,0,0,,Manon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.96,0:20:12.37,Manon,,0,0,0,,Alan...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.86,0:20:19.50,Alan,,0,0,0,,Were you scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.00,0:20:20.67,Manon,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.42,0:20:22.47,Manon,,0,0,0,,But, uhm...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.95,0:20:24.54,Manon,,0,0,0,,I was really worried, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.77,0:20:29.35,Alan,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.26,0:20:57.81,Reporter2,,0,0,0,,The brutal Pokémon that appeared off Kanazumi City have disappeared, restoring calm to the neighboring towns.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.43,0:21:02.50,Reporter2,,0,0,0,,Champion Daigo made an effort to put the situation under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.35,0:21:04.03,Platane,,0,0,0,,Could it be...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.30,0:21:04.76,Platane,,0,0,0,,Alan?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.12,0:21:09.01,Manon,,0,0,0,,What?! He went back?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.63,0:21:13.01,Daigo,,0,0,0,,He said that you'd only be in danger if you were by his side.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.50,0:21:14.84,Manon,,0,0,0,,I'll go back too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.11,0:21:15.68,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Manon-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.02,0:21:17.79,Manon,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.13,0:21:18.94,Daigo,,0,0,0,,If you want...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.10,0:21:20.73,Daigo,,0,0,0,,I'll give you a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.67,0:21:23.36,Manon,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.46,0:21:34.06,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,We've gained more Mega Evolution energy from this megalith than expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.71,0:21:38.23,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,The project that will attain the peace I aim for moves onto the next stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.00,0:21:40.31,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,It's thanks to you, Alan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.03,0:21:41.98,Alan,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.55,0:21:43.39,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,You've done a good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.23,0:21:45.50,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Rest for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.82,0:21:46.14,Alan,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.35,0:21:50.01,Alan,,0,0,0,,Neither me nor Lizardon are anywhere near being the strongest.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.75,0:21:54.80,Alan,,0,0,0,,I want to become strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.50,0:22:03.23,Trainer,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.39,0:22:05.31,Alan,,0,0,0,,Flamethrower!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.40,0:22:14.74,Alan,,0,0,0,,Dragon Claw!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.86,0:22:22.64,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,The events that transpired in Houen will lead to a change in the Kalos region's future.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.11,0:22:30.04,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,This change will be great tidings of joy to humanity and Pokémon alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.11,0:22:35.03,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,It won't be long before humanity will get to hear it.